  "title": "Warm shop fronts and daylight shadows",
  "summary": "Shop windows light the pavement at night, while people and decorations cast clearer daytime shadows.",
  "changes": [
    "Purchased corner shops and attached storefronts cast warm light outward onto sidewalks and roads after dusk.",
    "Window lighting follows the shop’s wall angle when placed, rotated, or moved.",
    "Daytime sunlight casts shadows from decorations and walking neighbors, with finer detail in Street view.",
    "Moving neighbors refresh their shadows with bounded desktop and mobile rendering costs."
